<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13154" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-pango</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, pactum, 3, <i>v.
				a., to drive down, drive in, fix into the ground</i> (rare).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">malleolum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 16, 1</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 3, 21, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 16,
				26, 46, § 110</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quercus et olea in scrobe depactae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 24,
					1, 1, § 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in terram depacta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					96, 98, § 211</span></i>
			. —* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitae depactus terminus alte tam manet, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 1087</span></i>
			.</div>
